OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump arrives in Ireland
OL,4,Afor two-day visit as major security
OL,5,Aoperation in place
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,8,Fin Dublin for the start of his two-day
OL,9,Fvisit to the Republic of Ireland
OL,11,FA red carpet is rolled out for the
OL,12,Fpresident's arrival as he is greeted by
OL,13,Fsenior figures of the Irish government
OL,15,FTrump is due to meet Irish President
OL,16,FCatherine Connolly at her official
OL,17,Fresidence in Phoenix Park - watch live
OL,18,Fabove
