OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump arrives in Ireland
OL,4,Afor two-day visit as major security
OL,5,Aoperation in place
OL,6,
OL,7,Fhold a courtesy call with Irish
OL,8,FPresident Catherine Connolly, and a
OL,9,Fbilateral meeting with Taoiseach (Irish
OL,10,FPrime Minister) Micheal Martin
OL,12,FTrump will then travel to his golf
OL,13,Fresort in Doonbeg, County Clare, where
OL,14,Fthe Irish Open golf tournament is being
OL,15,Fheld
OL,17,FIrish authorities have been planning
OL,18,Ffor Trump's visit for months in what
OL,19,Fwill be one of the biggest security
OL,20,Foperations in the history of the state
